@startuml
title Publication｜單一平台發布狀態
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft JhengHei
hide empty description
state "待人工發布 / pending" as pending
state "平台已排程 / scheduled" as scheduled
state "已實際發布 / published" as published
[*] --> pending : 建立發布紀錄 [成品版本已確認]
pending --> scheduled : 人完成平台原生排程 / 記錄預定時間
scheduled --> pending : 取消排程／尚未發布 / 更新紀錄
pending --> published : 人工發布並填回網址、時間
scheduled --> published : 確認已實際發布 / 填回網址、時間
published --> published : 回填成效 / 新增 MetricSnapshot
@enduml